<view class="screen">
  <text class="eyebrow">按自己的节奏来</text>
  <text class="page-title">让惦记，刚刚好。</text>
  <text class="page-subtitle">选择合适的提醒，把小事交给日常。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取设置…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{loadError}}" class="card empty section-space"><view class="empty-title">设置暂时未能加载</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="refresh">重新加载</button><view class="field-tip">如果清空过程曾中断，云端需等待五分钟后重试清空。</view><button class="text-button danger-text" bindtap="onClear" disabled="{{clearBusy}}" loading="{{clearBusy}}">重试清空当前数据</button></view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="section-space"><text class="section-title">合并提醒与免打扰</text><view class="card setting-group preference-panel"><view class="setting-name">微信提醒方式</view><view class="row preference-options"><button class="{{prefs.reminderMode === 'perTime' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="perTime" bindtap="onPrefMode">按任务时间</button><button class="{{prefs.reminderMode === 'digest' ? 'chosen' : ''}}" data-mode="digest" bindtap="onPrefMode">每日统一汇总</button></view><view class="field-tip">同一时段合并发送。统一汇总只提醒当天尚未确认的任务。</view><picker wx:if="{{prefs.reminderMode === 'digest'}}" mode="time" value="{{prefs.digestTime}}" data-field="digestTime" bindchange="onPrefTime"><view class="setting-row row between"><text>每日汇总时间</text><text>{{prefs.digestTime}} ›</text></view></picker><view class="setting-row row between"><text>睡眠免打扰</text><switch checked="{{prefs.quietEnabled}}" bindchange="onQuiet" color="#37634a" /></view><view wx:if="{{prefs.quietEnabled}}"><picker mode="time" value="{{prefs.quietStart}}" data-field="quietStart" bindchange="onPrefTime"><view class="setting-row row between"><text>开始</text><text>{{prefs.quietStart}} ›</text></view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{prefs.quietEnd}}" data-field="quietEnd" bindchange="onPrefTime"><view class="setting-row row between"><text>结束</text><text>{{prefs.quietEnd}} ›</text></view></picker></view><button class="primary" bindtap="onSavePreferences" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || clearBusy}}">保存提醒偏好</button></view><view class="notice section-space">免打扰内的微信提醒会跳过，不补发。已有手机日历由系统独立管理，不应用这里的合并或免打扰设置。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{cloud}}" class="section-space"><text class="section-title">离线与同步</text><view class="card preference-panel"><view>{{syncText || '当前没有待同步修改'}}</view><view class="field-tip">待同步：{{syncStatus.pendingCount || 0}} 项</view><view wx:if="{{syncStatus.lastSyncedAt}}" class="field-tip">上次同步：{{syncStatus.lastSyncedAt}}</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="onSync" loading="{{syncBusy}}" disabled="{{syncBusy}}">重新同步</button><button wx:if="{{syncStatus.conflict}}" class="text-button" bindtap="onDiscardPending" disabled="{{syncBusy}}">放弃本机草稿，使用云端数据</button></view><view class="field-tip">每次重新打开时需要先联网验证当前身份，然后可离线查看和编辑本机缓存。共同任务需联网。</view></view>
    <view class="row section-space"><button class="text-button" bindtap="onManage">管理全部任务 ›</button><button class="text-button" bindtap="onShared">双方共同任务 ›</button></view>
    <view class="section-space"><text class="section-title">提醒偏好</text><view class="card setting-group"><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="onTime" disabled="{{busy || clearBusy}}"><view class="setting-row row between"><view class="grow"><view class="setting-name">默认提醒时间</view><view class="setting-tip">用于之后新建的任务</view></view><text class="setting-value">{{time}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></view></picker><view class="divider"></view><button class="setting-row setting-button row between" bindtap="onSubscribe" loading="{{subscribeBusy}}" disabled="{{subscribeBusy}}"><view class="grow"><view class="setting-name">微信消息提醒</view><view class="setting-tip">点击申请，以实际授权结果为准</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></button><view class="divider"></view><button class="setting-row setting-button row between" bindtap="onCalendarHelp"><view class="grow"><view class="setting-name">手机日历提醒</view><view class="setting-tip">在每件小事的详情中单独添加</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></button></view><view class="notice reminder-notice">微信订阅消息需要你主动授权，不能保证无限期每日发送。日历提醒由手机系统管理，请检查通知权限。</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{pausedTasks.length}}" class="section-space"><text class="section-title">暂停的小事</text><view class="card setting-group"><block wx:for="{{pausedTasks}}" wx:key="id"><view wx:if="{{index > 0}}" class="divider"></view><button class="setting-row setting-button row between" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onPausedTask"><view class="grow"><view class="setting-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="setting-tip">{{item.platformLabel}} · 点开详情可以恢复</view></view><text class="chevron">›</text></button></block></view></view>
    <view class="section-space"><text class="section-title">数据与隐私</text><view class="card setting-group"><view class="setting-row"><view class="row between"><view class="setting-name">当前存储方式</view><text class="pill green">{{cloud ? '微信云开发' : '本机存储'}}</text></view><view class="setting-tip mode-description">{{cloud ? '云端数据与本机离线缓存分开保存。待同步修改尚未上传，联网并收到回执后才算同步完成。' : '任务和记录保存在当前设备的小程序缓存中，暂不跨设备同步。清理缓存可能造成数据丢失。'}}</view></view><view class="divider"></view><button class="setting-row setting-button row between" bindtap="onPrivacy"><text class="setting-name">隐私说明</text><text class="chevron">›</text></button><view class="divider"></view><button class="setting-row setting-button row between" bindtap="onClear" loading="{{clearBusy}}" disabled="{{clearBusy || busy}}"><text class="setting-name danger-text">{{cloud ? '清空我的云端数据' : '清空本机数据'}}</text><text class="chevron">›</text></button></view></view>
    <view class="about"><view class="about-name">续一下 <text>✦</text></view><view class="about-copy">把在意的，续下去。</view><view class="about-version">V 0.3.1 · 今日清单体验优化</view></view>
  </block>
</view>
